cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Battery Energy Storage System (BESS) Electro-Thermal & SoC Dynamics Solver"
message: "If you use this battery equivalent-circuit or electro-thermal solver in academic, research, or engineering work, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Haris
    family-names: Zafar
    alias: hariszafar740-lang
repository-code: "https://github.com/hariszafar740-lang/bess-soc-dynamics-solver"
abstract: >-
  Reduced-order electro-thermal simulation engine for lithium-ion battery
  energy storage cells, featuring unconditionally stable exact exponential
  integration of RC polarization and lumped Joule heat balance, reference-anchored
  Arrhenius resistance scaling, Coulomb-counted SoC, and closed-form verification.
keywords:
  - battery-energy-storage
  - lithium-ion
  - equivalent-circuit-model
  - electro-thermal
  - state-of-charge
  - python
license: MIT
version: 0.2.0
date-released: "2026-10-24"
